<title>USA: NationsBanc snags DLJ's Michael Weiner - source.</title>
<headline>NationsBanc snags DLJ's Michael Weiner - source.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>NationsBanc Capital Markets Inc has hired Michael Weiner, formerly the high-yield media and telecommunications analyst at Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities Corp, as an analyst in its high-yield research department, sources close to the situation said.</p>
<p>Spokespersons at both firms could not immediately confirm the move. Futher details about Weiner's new position were not immediately available.</p>
<p>NationsBanc is the investment banking subsidiary of NationsBank Corp.</p>
<p>((-Douglas Brown, 212-859-1662))</p>
</text>
